{"ID":"20260906161528-kelf2v4","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20260906161528-kelf2v4","title":"9.26","type":"doc","updated":"20260925220759"},"Children":[{"ID":"20260925142421-ah575p8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260925142421-ah575p8","updated":"20260925143847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"如果把推流换成 QUIC 协议，是否合适，会怎么样？"}]},{"ID":"20260925142421-soa1ksx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925142421-soa1ksx","updated":"20260925142421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"QUIC的核心优势对直播推流确实有吸引力：\n一是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"0-RTT快速建连和连接迁移"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，弱网、切网时重连几乎无感；\n二是多路复用"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"没有TCP队头阻"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"塞，单流丢包不拖累其他流；\n三是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"拥塞控制在用户态可插拔"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，能上BBR（拥塞控制算法）、做选择性重传和FEC，比TCP更适合高丢包链路\n================"}]},{"ID":"20260925142421-2qpc3st","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925142421-2qpc3st","updated":"20260925142421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但直接替换会有三个问题：\n第一，QUIC 走 UDP，部分企业网/运营商会拦截或限速，必须保留 TCP 回退；\n第二，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"QUIC 加解密和丢包恢复在用户态，高码率场景 CPU 开销明显高于内核态 TCP"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"；\n第三，QUIC 只是传输层，RTMP/SRT 这类推流协议还承担封装、时间戳、码率自适应语义，\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"换 QUIC 意味着要重建整套应用层协议和上下游生态（编码器、CDN、转码集群）"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260925142421-zm5qn7s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925142421-zm5qn7s","updated":"20260925142421"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"所以我的结论是：\n接收端分发用 HTTP/3 已经很成熟，值得上；\n推流端更适合\"QUIC 为主 + SRT/TCP 回退\"的混合架构，\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"按网络探测动态选路，收益主要来自弱网体验和首帧速度，而不是绝对延迟的量级下降"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260925143858-gwxymqd","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260925143858-gwxymqd","updated":"20260925143858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HLS\t\t"}]},{"ID":"20260925143858-hix3578","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925143858-hix3578","updated":"20260925143858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HLS 是苹果推出的、基于 HTTP 的流媒体传输协议，广泛用于视频点播和直播\n它的核心思路是把完整的视频流切分成一系列短小的 TS 格式切片文件，\n通常每段 2～10 秒，再通过一个 m3u8 索引文件来记录这些切片的顺序、时长和地址"}]},{"ID":"20260925143858-6jlqypp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925143858-6jlqypp","updated":"20260925143858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"========"}]},{"ID":"20260925143858-s663932","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925143858-s663932","updated":"20260925143858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"客户端播放时，会"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"先请求并解析 m3u8 文件"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，了解整体视频结构，\n然后"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"按顺序逐个下载 TS 切片进行播放"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，实现边下边播，不需要等待整个文件加载完成\nHLS 还支持多码率自适应，播放器可以根据当前网络状况自动切换清晰度，保证播放流畅"}]},{"ID":"20260925143858-ses2y6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925143858-ses2y6a","updated":"20260925143858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"========="}]},{"ID":"20260925143858-swd9rca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925143858-swd9rca","updated":"20260925143858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"HLS 的优势是兼容性极强，几乎所有浏览器、移动端和设备都原生支持，\n而且基于 HTTP 传输，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"防火墙穿透性好、部署简单"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n但因为需要等待切片生成和加载，延迟相对较高，一般在几秒到十几秒，不太适合对实时性要求很高的超低延迟直播场景。"}]},{"ID":"20260925143858-n8it70i","Type":"NodeTable","TableAligns":[0,1,0,0,0],"Properties":{"colgroup":"||||","id":"20260925143858-n8it70i","updated":"20260925143858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableHead","Data":"thead","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"协议"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"核心特点"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"延迟"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"兼容性"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"th","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"适用场景"}]}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"HLS"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"切片传输、HTTP 协议"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"高（3~10 秒 +）"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"极好"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"点播、普通直播、网页播放"}]}]},{"Type":"NodeTableRow","Data":"tr","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"RTMP"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","TableCellAlign":1,"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"长连接、低延迟、推流专用"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"中（1~3 秒）"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一般"}]},{"Type":"NodeTableCell","Data":"td","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"直播推流、低延迟直播"}]}]}]},{"ID":"20260925143858-kh4yz9h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260925143858-kh4yz9h","updated":"20260925151038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":".m3u8 是什么"}]},{"ID":"20260925143858-pojrl2d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925143858-pojrl2d","updated":"20260925143858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":".m3u8 是 HLS 流媒体的索引文件，本质是一个纯文本文件，不是视频文件\n它里面不存放音视频数据\n只记录所有 ts 视频分片的地址、分片时长、码率、加密信息、清晰度等播放信息"}]},{"ID":"20260925143858-hna3csm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925143858-hna3csm","updated":"20260925143858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"播放器播放时，先下载 m3u8 索引，解析里面的分片列表\n再依次 HTTP 请求下载一个个.ts 小视频分片，边下载边解码播放"}]},{"ID":"20260925143858-gbxccef","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925143858-gbxccef","updated":"20260925143858"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"直播场景下，m3u8 是动态更新的，服务端不断新增最新分片、删除旧分片\n客户端定时刷新索引实现持续直播\n点播场景 m3u8 是固定静态文件，支持拖拽进度条"}]},{"ID":"20260925151038-uef2zb6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260925151038-uef2zb6","updated":"20260925151625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"FLV 拿到任意一个 tag 就可以播放吗，有没有其他条件？"}]},{"ID":"20260925151038-vg83s9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925151038-vg83s9h","updated":"20260925151038"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"FLV 不能拿到任意一个 Tag 就直接播放。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"首先必须解析 FLV 头部以及 onMetadata 元数据 Tag"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，用来初始化音视频解码器；\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"其次首个视频 Tag 必须是 I 关键帧"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，如果上来是 P/B 帧，因缺少参考帧会出现花屏，无法正常解码。\n这也说明 FLV 的 Tag 不具备自包含特性，不能像 TS 分片那样，截取中间片段就可以独立开播。"}]},{"ID":"20260925152223-aliultw","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260925152223-aliultw","updated":"20260925153428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"IDR帧作用是什么"}]},{"ID":"20260925152223-p3igfgs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925152223-p3igfgs","updated":"20260925152223"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"IDR 帧是 H.264 里面特殊的 I 帧。GOP 起始帧 "},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"="}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"IDR 帧（特殊 I 帧）"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"收到 IDR 帧之后，解码器会"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"清空全部参考帧缓存"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，后面所有帧都不会再参考 IDR 之前的任何帧。\n 它主要两个作用：\n一是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"支持随机 seek 跳转"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，seek 到 IDR 帧位置可以直接开始解码出画面；\n二是直播断线重连、新用户接入的时候，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"收到 IDR 就能直接开播"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，不需要接收前面的历史帧，避免花屏。"}]},{"ID":"20260925153428-4tw5627","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":5,"Properties":{"id":"20260925153428-4tw5627","updated":"20260925211053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"项目中实现线程池基础的线程、信号量 API 是什么？"}]},{"ID":"20260925153428-ui3yjjf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925153428-ui3yjjf","updated":"20260925153428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"服务端线程池是纯 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"POSIX pthread "},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"打的：\n线程用 pthread_create 建，退出 pthread_exit，用 pthread_kill(tid, 0) 探活；\n同步没有用 sem 那套信号量，而是一把 pthread_mutex 加 not_full、not_empty 两个条件变量，\npthread_cond_wait/signal 做阻塞唤醒——本质是\"锁+条件变量模拟信号量\"。"}]},{"ID":"20260925153428-plhgeeu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925153428-plhgeeu","updated":"20260925153428"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"选条件变量而不是 sem，是因为消费者唤醒后要复合判断\"队列是否为空、池是否已关闭\"，\n|还得防虚假唤醒，信号量计数做不了这个。\n结构是"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"生产者-消费者加环形任务队列"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\nManager 线程按忙碌率在 10 到 200 个线程间弹性扩缩容，\n配合 epoll 加 EPOLLONESHOT 把收包丢进池里，接收和业务处理分离。"}]},{"ID":"20260925211053-ysttlrk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260925211053-ysttlrk","updated":"20260925212448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大模型处理长文本时容易跳读、只提取局部信息做判断，该如何解决？"}]},{"ID":"20260925211053-6p6qusx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925211053-6p6qusx","updated":"20260925211053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"没真正读全数据就凭局部模式下结论。\n我的处理思路分三层："}]},{"ID":"20260925211053-9t1e819","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925211053-9t1e819","updated":"20260925211053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"从输入端逼它读全"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n把数据"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"分块"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"喂进去，要求"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"逐块输出要点再汇总"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，而不是一次性塞给它下结论；\n同时在"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"提示词里明确\"必须覆盖全部数据，先列事实再给规律\""},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，并要求"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"结论必须带数据出处"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。"}]},{"ID":"20260925211053-xk6z706","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925211053-xk6z706","updated":"20260925211053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"从验证端兜底"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n让它"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"对同一份数据做交叉校验"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n比如抽样复核、或者"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"用另一个任务反问它\"某个边缘数据你怎么解释\""},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n——答不上来就说明没读全。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"关键结论最好用代码算一遍"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"而不是让模型自己估。"}]},{"ID":"20260925211053-ymt0gun","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925211053-ymt0gun","updated":"20260925211053"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第三，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"从机制上留一手"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"把提取、推理、验证拆成独立步骤甚至不同模型分工，重要场景加人工抽检。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20260925212448-guulb1n","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260925212448-guulb1n","updated":"20260925214217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"当大模型输出结果达不到预期，一般可以采取哪些措施"}]},{"ID":"20260925212448-xbbnroq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925212448-xbbnroq","updated":"20260925212448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第一层，看输入。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n大概率问题出在提示词上——指令够不够明确、有没有给足背景和示例。\n模糊的提问只能换来模糊的回答，所以先补上下文、加 few-shot 样例、把输出格式要求写死。"}]},{"ID":"20260925212448-8fdjv75","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925212448-8fdjv75","updated":"20260925212448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第二层，看任务拆分。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n一口气让模型干十件事，效果肯定差。\n把复杂任务拆成链式步骤，让每步的输出成为下一步的输入，复杂问题就变成了若干个简单问题。"}]},{"ID":"20260925212448-tqepwwr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925212448-tqepwwr","updated":"20260925212448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第三层，看能力边界。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n知识性不足就接外部数据，比如 RAG 检索增强或调用工具/代码执行；\n推理不够就换成思维链或更强的模型；\n领域偏差就用微调或领域语料做对齐。"}]},{"ID":"20260925212448-z2q6r20","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925212448-z2q6r20","updated":"20260925212448"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"第四层，看结果验收。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n建立自动化的评估指标和测试集，而不是靠肉眼感觉，用评测结果反推该调哪一环。"}]},{"ID":"20260925214217-3f68vyc","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260925214217-3f68vyc","updated":"20260925215109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"你对Harness有没有思考或者实践"}]},{"ID":"20260925214217-ko7eljx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925214217-ko7eljx","updated":"20260925214217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我对Harness的理解是：\n它是包在大模型外面的那层“脚手架”，Harness更像是造Agent那一层。\n过去我们主要是在Agent里面加能力：装skills、接MCP、增加工具\n而Harness往前走了一层：\nTool、Skills、Loop、Context，甚至Agent的运行方式，都可以被重新组合。\n“"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一切皆插件"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"”\n不是插件变多了，而是Agent本身开始变成一个可以被修改、被定义的对象。"}]},{"ID":"20260925214217-fojo666","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925214217-fojo666","updated":"20260925214217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"================="}]},{"ID":"20260925214217-jhhi1fj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925214217-jhhi1fj","updated":"20260925214217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"我的实践集中在Agent"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"流程和评测"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"两块"}]},{"ID":"20260925214217-gfmvo9u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925214217-gfmvo9u","updated":"20260925214217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一，模型能力是地板，Harness 是天花板。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"同一个模型，Harness 设计得好坏，效果能差出一大截"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"比如上下文怎么压缩和召回、工具怎么定义和报错重试、什么时候反思回滚"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n——这些工程细节往往比换一个更大的模型收益更高、成本更低。"}]},{"ID":"20260925214217-ss2hqxm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925214217-ss2hqxm","updated":"20260925214217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"====="}]},{"ID":"20260925214217-rbiudbj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925214217-rbiudbj","updated":"20260925214217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二，我的实践集中在 "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"Agent 流程和评测"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"两块。\nAgent 这边，我做过基于 ReAct 的工具调用循环，\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"重点打磨了工具的粒度设计和错误信息回传"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"——工具描述写得清晰、报错能被模型读懂，成功率会明显提升；\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"还做了长任务的上下文分段和摘要记忆"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，避免关键信息被挤出窗口。\n评测这边，我搭过自动化的 Eval Harness，用固定测试集加评分规则跑回归，\n每次改提示词或换模型都能量化对比，避免\"感觉变好了\"这种主观判断。"}]},{"ID":"20260925214217-sl1wyby","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925214217-sl1wyby","updated":"20260925214217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"====="}]},{"ID":"20260925214217-gzpfb78","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925214217-gzpfb78","updated":"20260925214217"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第三，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"我的体会是 Harness 要为可调试性设计"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n每一步的输入输出、工具调用链路都要"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"留痕"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，出错时能定位到具体是哪一环，这样才能持续迭代，而不是靠猜。"}]},{"ID":"20260925215109-w5m1ac0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260925215109-w5m1ac0","updated":"20260925220324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"大模型处理数字容易产生幻觉，有人认为应当尽量不让AI读取原始数据，你如何看待这个观点？"}]},{"ID":"20260925215109-2r9x1r7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925215109-2r9x1r7","updated":"20260925215109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这个观点我觉得抓住了问题，但开错了药方。"}]},{"ID":"20260925215109-2qdbt25","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925215109-2qdbt25","updated":"20260925215109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第一，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"不让它读数据，幻觉只会更严重"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n模型拿不到真实数据，就只能凭参数里的印象去编，那才是真正的无中生有。\n读了数据至少有了锚点，不读数据就是闭着眼睛瞎猜。"}]},{"ID":"20260925215109-d17iymi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925215109-d17iymi","updated":"20260925215109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第二，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"正确的做法是把\"读\"和\"算\"分开"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n模型擅长理解语义、抽取信息，但不擅长精确计算。\n所以"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"让模型负责定位和提取，把加减乘除、统计口径这类活交给代码或数据库去算"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，\n模型只做最后的组织表达——各干各擅长的事，幻觉自然就压下来了。"}]},{"ID":"20260925215109-183sxlo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925215109-183sxlo","updated":"20260925215109"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"第三，"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"再加一道验证闭环"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n要求"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"结论带数据出处、能回溯到原文"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，关键数字做交叉核对，\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"输出前过一遍一致性检查"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。这样即使出错也能发现、能定位。"}]},{"ID":"20260925220324-98es2j6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260925220324-98es2j6","updated":"20260925220759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"shared_ptr按值传递和按引用传递有什么区别？"}]},{"ID":"20260925220324-8dqsh87","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925220324-8dqsh87","updated":"20260925220324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"两者的本质区别"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"在引用计数和生命周期"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。\n按值传递 shared"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ptr 会拷贝，引用计数原子 + 1，函数作用域内对象一定存活，但有原子操作开销。\n传 const 引用不增加引用计数，性能更高，但不持有所有权，外部对象销毁后会失效。"}]},{"ID":"20260925220759-n5s0gq5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":4,"Properties":{"id":"20260925220759-n5s0gq5","updated":"20260925220759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"是否有必要用引用传递shared_ptr？"}]},{"ID":"20260925220759-53073il","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20260925220759-53073il","updated":"20260925220759"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"只能用 const shared_ptr\u0026lt;T\u0026gt;\u0026amp;"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color11);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"，不是普通引用。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color11);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"\n如果函数只"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color3);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"临时"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color3);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"访问对象、不保存智能指针，传 const 引用可以避免 shared"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ptr 拷贝带来的原子增减，减少性能开销。\n但它不持有所有权，外部 shared"},{"Type":"NodeBackslash","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"_"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"ptr 释放后，这个引用就会悬空。\n"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color2);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"一旦函数需要把指针存起来、交给异步线程，就不能用引用，必须传值来拿到独立所有权。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color2);\"}"}]}]}